+# Third-Party Notices
+
+The locked runtime uses permissively licensed libraries including NumPy (BSD and bundled component notices), Rasterio (BSD-3-Clause), PyProj (MIT), Shapely (BSD-3-Clause), Trimesh (MIT), Pillow (MIT-CMU), Pydantic (MIT), Typer (MIT), PyYAML (MIT), SciPy (BSD-3-Clause and wheel component notices), and lib3mf 2.5.0 (BSD-2-Clause). Exact versions and hashes are in `uv.lock`; installed distributions carry their full notices.
+
+OrcaSlicer and PrusaSlicer are separately installed GNU AGPL-3.0 applications. They are executed as independent processes and are not included in TopoForge source or packages.
